{"Id":1413,"Introduction":{"Title":"No Description Available","Content":"A reclusive sword cultivator who holds the nominal title of Xuan Paragon of Xuanfang Hold, and a peerless master of both qin and sword. Aloof and distant, she seems untouched by emotion.\nThe world knows her as the Sword Transcendent. For years beyond counting, she has stood guard over these lands, and the cold light of her blade remains as keen as the day she first drew it."},"Properties":[{"Name":"HP","BaseValue":824},{"Name":"ATK","BaseValue":37},{"Name":"DEF","BaseValue":91},{"Name":"Crit. Rate","BaseValue":500},{"Name":"Crit. DMG","BaseValue":15000},{"Name":"Tune Break Boost","BaseValue":10}],"Skills":[{"SkillId":1005801,"SkillType":"Normal Attack","SkillName":"Strings to Steel","SkillDescribe":"<span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Basic Attack - Stringblade</span></span><br><br>Press repeatedly or hold <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Normal Attack</span> to perform up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing <span style=\"color:#c7ffed\";>Aero DMG</span>.<br><span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Basic Attack - Stringblade Stage 1</span> and <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Basic Attack - Stringblade Stage 4</span> are in <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Sheathed Stance</span>.<br><span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Basic Attack - Stringblade Stage 2</span> and <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Basic Attack - Stringblade Stage 3</span> are in <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Drawn Stance</span>.<br><size=10></span><br><br><span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Heavy Attack - Stringblade</span></span><br><br>When <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\"><te href=141301>Qin Heart</te></span> and <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\"><te href=141302>Sword Cadence</te></span> are full, <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Heavy Attack - Stringblade</span> becomes available.<br>Hold <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Normal Attack</span> to consume STA and cast this skill, dealing <span style=\"color:#c7ffed\";>Aero DMG</span>.<br>Casting this skill consumes all <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\"><te href=141301>Qin Heart</te></span> and <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\"><te href=141302>Sword Cadence</te></span> and sends Qingxiao into the <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\"><te href=141303>Ephemeral Transcendence</te></span> state.<br><size=10></span><br><br><span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Mid-air Attack - Stringblade</span></span><br><br>Press <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Normal Attack</span> consecutively or hold it down to perform up to 3 consecutive attacks, dealing <span style=\"color:#c7ffed\";>Aero DMG</span>.<br>This skill is in <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Drawn Stance</span>.<br>After landing from <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Mid-air Attack - Stringblade Stage 3</span>, press or hold <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Normal Attack</span> within a certain time to cast <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Basic Attack - Stringblade Stage 3</span>.<br>While in mid-air, <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Resonance Skill</span> is replaced by <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Mid-air Attack - Stringblade Stage 3</span>.<br><size=10></span><br><br><span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Plunging Attack</span></span><br><br>While in the <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\"><te href=141306>Sword Flight</te></span> state, <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Jump</span> is replaced by <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Plunging Attack</span>.<br>Consume STA to perform a Plunging Attack, dealing <span style=\"color:#c7ffed\";>Aero DMG</span>.<br>While out of the <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Ephemeral Transcendence</span> state, press <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Normal Attack</span> within a certain time after casting this skill to cast <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Basic Attack - Stringblade Stage 3</span>.<br><size=10></span><br><br><span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Dodge Counter - Stringblade</span></span><br><br>Press <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Normal Attack</span> within a certain time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <span style=\"color:#c7ffed\";>Aero DMG</span>.<br>This skill is in <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Drawn Stance</span>.<br>Press or hold <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Normal Attack</span> within a certain time after casting this skill to cast <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Basic Attack - Stringblade Stage 4</span>.<br><size=10></span><br><br><span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Sword Glide</span></span><br><br>While in mid-air, <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Dodge</span> is replaced by <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Sword Glide</span>.","SkillAttributes":[{"attributeId":1413001,"attributeName":"Basic Attack - Stringblade Stage 1 DMG","values":["15.16%*2","16.40%*2","17.65%*2","19.39%*2","20.63%*2","22.06%*2","24.05%*2","26.03%*2","28.02%*2","30.13%*2","32.62%*2","35.11%*2","37.59%*2","40.08%*2","42.56%*2","45.05%*2","47.53%*2","50.02%*2","52.50%*2","54.99%*2"],"Description":""},{"attributeId":1413002,"attributeName":"Basic Attack - Stringblade Stage 2 DMG","values":["18.66%*2","20.19%*2","21.72%*2","23.86%*2","25.39%*2","27.15%*2","29.60%*2","32.04%*2","34.49%*2","37.09%*2","40.15%*2","43.21%*2"