lor:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Exorcising Seal</span> and trigger <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Juque Perdition</span>, dealing <span style=\"color:#c7ffed\";>Aero DMG</span> equal to 400% of Qingxiao's ATK, considered Basic Attack DMG. This effect can be triggered up to once per second. For each stack of <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Exorcising Seal</span> removed, the target takes 4% more DMG from <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Juque Perdition</span> for 2s.<br><span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Exorcising Seal</span> stacks up to 25 times.","BgDescription":"PrefabTextItem_Empty_Text","BuffIds":[1413701101,1413701102,1413701605],"AddProp":[],"ActivateConsume":[{"Key":10001413,"Value":1}],"AttributesDescriptionParams":["16%","2","1","25","400%","4%","2","25"],"NodeIcon":"/Game/Aki/UI/UIResources/Common/Image/IconDevice/T_IconDevice_QingxiaoM1_UI.webp"},{"Id":332,"GroupId":1413,"GroupIndex":2,"NodeType":1,"NodeIndex":"ResonantChain_128_NodeIndex","NodeName":"Like Petals That Fall Without a Sound","AttributesDescription":"The DMG Multiplier of <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Heavy Attack - Stringblade</span> is increased by 40%.<br><size=10></span><br><br>After entering combat, the max stack limit of <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\"><te href=141304>Mindlock</te></span> on nearby enemies is increased to 25.<br>The max stack limit of <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Gathered Mind</span> from <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Inherent Skill - Sea of Thought, World of Dust</span> is increased to 25.<br><size=10></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\"><te href=141309>Heaven's Clarity</te></span> is enhanced:<br>Casting <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Heavy Attack - Stringblade</span> now inflicts 6 stack of <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\"><te href=141304>Min